 신앙하게 된 것은 별 문뎨이지요.”(1928년 12월 7일자 2면)","date":"2026-06-28T20:00:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/06/29/2KZQRYIFMRDMZBLR35LEHASEJI/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[전문기자의 시선] 의무 없는 일 헌신해 쌓은 존경… 종교계, 11월 말 받을 성적표는?","partialText":"","date":"2026-06-29T14:33:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/relion-academia/2026/06/29/6GDOYH77QBDILFT5UQRDWAF2J4/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"붉은 등 달고, 깃털로 채운 방… 여성 작가들의 ‘실험’ 속으로","partialText":"","date":"2026-06-28T15:41:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/06/29/CXDW2JA5GNDHTCJW2RLZLYOA2E/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[TV조선] 박규리 모녀의 건강 고민","partialText":"","date":"2026-06-29T15:39:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/broadcast-media/2026/06/30/MYWBMIPFHRER3CSF3USJ4AFXXI/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["culture"],"url":"https://www.chosun.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/category/culture-life/?outputType=xml"},"title":"[일사일언] 할머니의 ‘마음 속 괄호’","partialText":"","date":"2026-06-29T15:42:00.000Z","url":"https://www.chosun.com/culture-life/culture_general/2026/06/30/JCCPMPHXWZG6NC7GYBVGPPA4GY/"},{"spec":{"publisher":{"id":"chosun","name":"조선일보","type":"종합일간지","url":"https://www.chosun.com"},"title":"문화/라이프","categories":["